{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226928","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226928","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422692801:1":{"text":"おい、平民！恵の霊水は、貴族に優先して配られることを知らないのか！？","source_cn":"平民，你怎敢反抗？难道不知道恩典灵露应当优先供应给贵族吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECFEE5F3C525F0E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422692802:1":{"text":"ふ、ふざけるな！俺の子どもだって、厄化を抑えるために霊水が必要なんだ！","source_cn":"凭、凭什么！我的孩子同样需要灵露抵抗孽化！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05776FBAC398A3AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422692803:1":{"text":"それに、い、今はみんな立場は同じなんだろ？貴族なんて、何の意味もないんだ！","source_cn":"何、何况，现在大家都一样！你的贵族身份，不值钱了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51E718D18E2EC722","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422692804:1":{"text":"はっ！霊水の力を正しく使えるのは、高貴な血筋を持つ者だけなんだぞ！","source_cn":"愚蠢！只有高贵血脉才能正确使用灵露的力量！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A9490F435C56ED8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422692805:1":{"text":"でたらめを言うな！霊水は呪いを抑えるためのものだ。すべてのエクシルに、それを手にする権利がある！","source_cn":"荒谬！灵露是为了抵御诅咒的影响，所有艾塞勒人都有资格获取。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7287E530B9347059","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422692806:1":{"text":"い、インドラ様！？なぜここに……？","source_cn":"因、因度厄大人？您怎么会在这里……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF520D1B344DF2828","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422692807:1":{"text":"霊水の異常供給について調べている。何か言いたいことがあるのなら、話を聞くが？","source_cn":"我正在调查灵露异常流通的情况。看来你对此很有见解？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9A344497E1C17F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422692808:1":{"text":"わ、私はただ、平民に礼儀というものを……","source_cn":"我……我只是在教导这些平民应有的礼节……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D737D80B1AFDCFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422692809:1":{"text":"インドラ様！こいつは、「伝統だ」とか言って、俺が買った霊水を奪おうとしたんだ！","source_cn":"大人！他要抢走我买到的灵露！说这是“传统”！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFDBE16BEEB96E80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422692810:1":{"text":"……あ、いや、もう用はないので、私は失礼します！","source_cn":"……我、我没事了，我先告辞！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x895AB481ED412678","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:14:1422692811:0":{"text":"霊水を奪おうとした貴族は、そそくさと去っていった。もう一人の平民も、早く立ち去りたくてソワソワしている。","source_cn":"抢夺灵露的贵族飞快地溜走了，只剩不安的平民，似乎要想要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64D9D04A24286761","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422692812:1":{"text":"た、助かったよ！それじゃあ、俺も――","source_cn":"谢谢因度厄大人！我也先——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59F50A525CCCA981","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422692813:1":{"text":"待て。「買った霊水」と言ったな？霊水は問題なく配給されているはずだろう？","source_cn":"别走，买来的灵露是怎么回事？现在不是正常配给吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197D7DE3BDE3CE4A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422692814:1":{"text":"そ、それは……霊水が底をつきそうだって聞いたんだ！……だから、闇市から買ったんだよ。","source_cn":"大人……我听说灵露快、快没了！只能从暗市买了点……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00A6A0AC22E7A35E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1422692815:1":{"text":"これからは、貴族だけがもらえるって……それで、俺……","source_cn":"他们说……之后只有贵族才能获得供应……我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC0329D4149992A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422692816:0":{"text":"誰がそんな噂を流してるんだ？","source_cn":"谁在散布这种谣言？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x127935B4EB664BF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1422692817:1":{"text":"そ、それは、言えない……","source_cn":"我、我不敢说……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F3DDB8B237B9BD5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1422692818:1":{"text":"大丈夫ですよ。私たちはそれを解決しに来たんです。","source_cn":"不必害怕，我们就是来解决此事的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FCB7036E5B7F7C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1422692819:0":{"text":"……銀月の祭壇の司祭たちだよ……それに、呪いは嘘だとも言ってた……！","source_cn":"好吧……是银月祭庭的祭司们……她们说诅咒是假的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC80A4B1F8EDC5E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1422692819":{"text":"……銀月の祭壇の司祭たちだよ……それに、呪いは嘘だとも言ってた……！","source_cn":"好吧……是银月祭庭的祭司们……她们说诅咒是假的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC80A4B1F8EDC5E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1422692820:1":{"text":"お、俺はそう聞いただけだよ。呪いも竜の話も、全部嘘だって言われたんだ。","source_cn":"我、我就是复述。她们说那些关于诅咒和龙的故事都是谎言。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5727CD6E8F562A17","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1422692821:1":{"text":"優しい女王陛下が亡くなって、霊水の源泉もまもなく枯れる。もう、エクシル全員に行き渡るだけの量は残っていない……","source_cn":"仁慈的女王陛下死后，灵露源头就在逐渐枯竭，根本不够所有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30348DEE463B270B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1422692822:1":{"text":"それから、地上に行けば新世界が待ってるって話は、サリエ様が真相を隠すためについた嘘だって……","source_cn":"她们还说，沙利叶大人为了掩盖真相，才声称地表上有新世界...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AD13FCDFD3B17D1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1422692823:1":{"text":"その話を信じて地上に行った連中は、みんな厄化した。さ、サリエ様は、みんなを騙して殺そうとしてるんだ！","source_cn":"而听信传言去地表的人，都孽化了。沙、沙利叶大人其实是在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA088DB2ABBBF7E14","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1422692824:1":{"text":"いろいろ破綻していますが……何も知らなければ、信じてしまいそうな話ですね。","source_cn":"有漏洞，但在我一个外人听来，这确实很像真的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25FEFEA11ED68BEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1422692825:1":{"text":"だから、みんな疑い始めたんだよ！お、俺も……","source_cn":"所以……很多人开始怀疑了！我、我也……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x87444A14375633FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1422692826:1":{"text":"いいか、私は地上から戻ってきたばかりだ。呪いは間違いなく存在するが、解除法はすでに見つけてある。","source_cn":"听着，我刚从地表回来。诅咒确实存在，但我们也找到了解除...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9CA89070943449B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1422692827:1":{"text":"もうすぐ、私たちは霊水に頼らずとも生きていけるんだ。","source_cn":"很快，所有艾塞勒人都不必再依赖灵露！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8C75C5E8583C390","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1422692828:1":{"text":"本当か？で、でも、デリア様が――","source_cn":"真的吗？可德莱雅大人说——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8FB7CB58596D1C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:36:1422692828":{"text":"本当か？で、でも、デリア様が――","source_cn":"真的吗？可德莱雅大人说——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8FB7CB58596D1C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1422692829:1":{"text":"ああ、俺に霊水を売った人だよ……","source_cn":"就是、我就是从她那里买到了灵露……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA0C69E3245E048F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1422692830:0":{"text":"そいつはどこで霊水を売っている？","source_cn":"她在哪里交易灵露？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25737E5ECEEE58E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1422692831:1":{"text":"銀月の祭壇だ……三日に一回、夕方に秘密の集会があるんだ。","source_cn":"银月祭庭……每三天的黄昏会有一次秘密集会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43736027B7B8D61E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1422692832:1":{"text":"分かった。情報提供に感謝する。","source_cn":"我知道了，多谢你的信息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x090C073635E333FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1422692833:1":{"text":"なあ……い、一体どれが本当でどれが嘘なんだ？俺、厄化したくねえよ……","source_cn":"大人——到底什么是真的？我只是不想孽化……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BEC6A66BCF7EC8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1422692834:1":{"text":"もう少し待っていろ。必ず真相は明らかになる。","source_cn":"等着看吧，真相会大白的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B3FBC81EE6538F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:36:0:1":{"text":"デリア様？","source_cn":"她是谁？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x530E12107F32AA44","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"デリア様？","female":"デリア様？","variant_male_record_index":"73048","variant_female_record_index":"73049","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:24:0:1":{"text":"呪いは本当だ。","source_cn":"诅咒是真的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8F483592A8FAFE1F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"呪いは本当だ。","female":"呪いは本当よ。","variant_male_record_index":"73046","variant_female_record_index":"73047","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贪婪的贵族":{"text":"貪欲な貴族","source":"贪婪的贵族","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:愤怒的平民":{"text":"激怒している平民","source":"愤怒的平民","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"インドラ","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:黑屏字幕":{"text":"黒画面字幕","source":"黑屏字幕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"エルロン","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":39,"localized_text_count":38,"speaker_count":5}}